# UR Cutter vs Alurentell. Part B: Aluren, Acererak and dungeons, Atraxa, Omniscience.

=== aluren-free-cast-any-time-p1
title: Aluren: its controller casts Acererak (MV 3) for free at instant speed during the opponent's turn
ref: Aluren Oracle (free and as though it had flash)
state:
  activeplayer=p2
  activephase=UPKEEP
  humanhand=Acererak the Archlich
  humanbattlefield=Aluren
script:
  p1: at p2:UPKEEP
  p1: cast Acererak the Archlich ~free
  p1: pick Lost Mine of Phandelver
expect:
  zone p1 hand has "Acererak the Archlich"
  spells p1 == 1

=== aluren-opponent-may-cast-free
title: Aluren: the OPPONENT (no lands) casts Dragon's Rage Channeler for free at instant speed
ref: Aluren Oracle ("Any player may cast")
xfail: FORGE BUG. Aluren's static sets MayPlayPlayer$ Player and StaticAbilityContinuous takes getDefinedPlayers(...).get(0), so only the first player in the game's player list gets the free-cast permission. The second seat can never use Aluren (checked with p2 as Aluren's controller and as its opponent).
state:
  humanbattlefield=Aluren
  aihand=Dragon's Rage Channeler
script:
  p1: pass
  p2: cast Dragon's Rage Channeler ~free
expect:
  zone p2 battlefield has "Dragon's Rage Channeler"

=== aluren-seat-order-second-seat-controller
title: Aluren with the seats swapped (p1 is second in Forge's player list): its controller p1 casts Dragon's Rage Channeler for free
ref: Aluren Oracle. Same cause as aluren-opponent-may-cast-free: the permission goes to whoever is first in the player list.
swap-seats: yes
xfail: FORGE BUG (see aluren-opponent-may-cast-free). The Aluren controller cannot use Aluren when seated second.
state:
  humanbattlefield=Aluren
  humanhand=Dragon's Rage Channeler
script:
  p1: cast Dragon's Rage Channeler ~free
expect:
  zone p1 battlefield has "Dragon's Rage Channeler"

=== aluren-seat-order-first-seat-opponent
title: Aluren with the seats swapped: the OPPONENT p2 (first in Forge's player list) can cast for free
ref: Aluren Oracle
swap-seats: yes
state:
  humanbattlefield=Aluren
  aihand=Dragon's Rage Channeler
script:
  p1: pass
  p2: cast Dragon's Rage Channeler ~free
expect:
  zone p2 battlefield has "Dragon's Rage Channeler"

=== aluren-mv-limit-four
title: Aluren does not let a player cast a creature with mana value above 3 for free (Murktide Regent MV 7, Atraxa MV 7)
ref: Aluren Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Atraxa, Grand Unifier
  humanbattlefield=Aluren
  aihand=Murktide Regent
script:
  p1: try cast Atraxa, Grand Unifier ~free
  p2: try cast Murktide Regent ~free
expect:
  zone p1 hand has "Atraxa, Grand Unifier"
  zone p2 hand has "Murktide Regent"
  zone p1 battlefield lacks "Atraxa, Grand Unifier"

=== aluren-noncreature-not-free
title: Aluren does not make noncreature spells free (Brainstorm cast with no mana fails)
ref: Aluren Oracle ("creature spells")
state:
  humanhand=Brainstorm
  humanbattlefield=Aluren
script:
  p1: try cast Brainstorm
  p1: try cast Brainstorm ~free
expect:
  zone p1 hand has "Brainstorm"

=== aluren-creature-card-in-graveyard
title: Aluren gives no permission to cast creature cards from the graveyard (Dragon's Rage Channeler in graveyard)
ref: Aluren Oracle; CR 601.2a (cards are cast from hand unless a rule or effect says otherwise)
state:
  humanbattlefield=Aluren
  humangraveyard=Dragon's Rage Channeler
script:
  p1: try cast Dragon's Rage Channeler ~free
expect:
  zone p1 graveyard has "Dragon's Rage Channeler"
  zone p1 battlefield lacks "Dragon's Rage Channeler"

=== aluren-creature-card-in-exile
title: Aluren gives no permission to cast creature cards from exile
ref: Aluren Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Aluren
  humanexile=Dragon's Rage Channeler
script:
  p1: try cast Dragon's Rage Channeler ~free
expect:
  zone p1 exile has "Dragon's Rage Channeler"

=== aluren-creature-card-top-of-library
title: Aluren gives no permission to cast the creature card on top of the library
ref: Aluren Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Aluren
  humanlibrary=Dragon's Rage Channeler;Island;Island
script:
  p1: try cast Dragon's Rage Channeler ~free
expect:
  zone p1 library has "Dragon's Rage Channeler"

=== aluren-opponent-hand-not-castable
title: Aluren: a player cannot cast creature cards from the OPPONENT's hand
ref: CR 601.2a
state:
  humanbattlefield=Aluren
  aihand=Dragon's Rage Channeler
script:
  p1: try cast Dragon's Rage Channeler@p2 ~free
expect:
  zone p2 hand has "Dragon's Rage Channeler"

=== acererak-loop-lost-mine
title: Acererak with Aluren: each free cast returns it to hand and ventures; Lost Mine rooms Cave Entrance -> Goblin Lair -> Dark Pool
ref: Acererak the Archlich Oracle; CR 701.49 (venture), Lost Mine of Phandelver room text
state:
  humanhand=Acererak the Archlich
  humanbattlefield=Aluren
script:
  p1: cast Acererak the Archlich ~free
  p1: pick Lost Mine of Phandelver
  p1: cast Acererak the Archlich ~free
  p1: pick Goblin Lair
  p1: cast Acererak the Archlich ~free
  p1: pick Dark Pool
expect:
  zone p1 hand has "Acererak the Archlich"
  zone p1 battlefield lacks "Acererak the Archlich"
  life p2 == 19
  life p1 == 21
  spells p1 == 3
  zone p1 command has "Lost Mine of Phandelver"
